<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    St. Patrick's Day: a rainbow paints itself over the G from a cloud on one side to a pot of gold on the other, and
    coins jump out of the pot as it lands. It holds, drains away into the pot, rests, and comes again; shamrocks nod
    below. One 3.6s loop.

    See doodle_halloween.xml for the layout: a 48x48 viewport around the widget's own G (12..36), which isn't drawn here.
-->
